;; Root of raylib-clj-demo. Every demo is its own sub-project (<demo>/deps.edn)
;; and runs from its own directory with `clojure -M:run`, which is where its
;; resources/ resolve. These root aliases run the same namespaces from here, so
;; a demo that loads files from resources/ needs `bb <demo>` or its own
;; directory instead. `clojure -M:check` compiles every scene with no window.
;;
;; Generated by `bb gen` from demos.edn. Don't hand-edit the aliases: add the
;; demo to demos.edn and re-run it instead. raylib-clj arrives through common/,
;; which pins it by git sha.
